      "title": "kerberos: Fix potential issue with length computation",
      "message": "kerberos: Fix potential issue with length computation\n\nKerberos TCP oversized record mark can cause pre-validation\nTCP reassembly resource exhaustion.\nFix size check to avoid potential wrap.\n\nFixes #21468\n\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <ronniesahlberg@gmail.com>\n",
      "author_name": "Ronnie Sahlberg",
      "author_email": "ronniesahlberg@gmail.com",
